611.description:
Submerged – a new adventure project from Uppercut Games, previously known for its shooters with a unique atmosphere. As usual, all new projects have limited information regarding gameplay and other features. However, a small amount of information is available, such as the fact that the game will be compatible with various devices.

Game features:
- According to the creators' idea, the story will tell of a lonely man who sets out on a voyage, and there will be no ships here, so there is no point in imagining pirate adventures on some "Black Roger" or the like, you will have to sail on a boat along an ordinary river;
- But you are given the opportunity to walk along the shore, search the building in search of supplies - water or food, necessary medicines;
- Traveling by land is fraught with danger, for example, some buildings may collapse, etc.;
- The rest of the information about the game is not reliable, but it does exist, for example, the fact that the hero is not just swimming, exploring the nearby lands, but is searching for his brother, who (again, rumors!) is dying in one of the dilapidated buildings;
- In any case, the solution will be found in the game itself and by getting to know the storyline, which, according to the creators' plan, should become a staged action movie with moments of detective horror;
The Unreal Engine provides the full beauty of the action, judging by its characteristics and the results it delivers in other projects – this includes excellent detail, magnificent animation during destruction, and so on.
- On August 4th, everyone will be able to download the game. Submerged via torrent from us.

4390.description:
Nothing new – another cool survival game for those who enjoy extreme computer activities.

Download Naked and Afraid: The Game torrent for free in Russian and create a unique character to protect from harm on a Pacific island for three weeks. You'll hunt and cook food, gather resources, and build a safe and secure home. Beware of tropical downpours and unbearable heat, which will add to your challenges. Survive longer and you'll receive a more valuable reward.

The game involves competing against other players around the world. Survive as long as possible by wisely using limited resources. To reach the top of the "Naked and Afraid" project, you need to develop not only tactical but also strategic thinking.

The game is meticulously designed and realistic. The climate is constantly changing, and wild animals follow the day/night cycle. Fire can easily start a fire around you, but it can also be extinguished with water. You'll need to choose the optimal time of day for hunting, but prey will be on the alert, so use your stealth skills.

Key features
- very realistic survival;
- hunt wild animals using homemade traps and bait;
- choose whether to eat raw food or cook over a fire;
- new conditions are generated each time, making the game interesting to play again and again;
- death is the end of the game, no checkpoints or saving;
- the ability to download new add-ons.

Installation:
1. Download and unzip the game
2. Run the NakedAndAfraid.exe file
3. Play.
